"""1000 fully specified conditional role/task packets,not observedlifeworlds.
Public pre-event simulated state is an input;post-event energy/temperature
labels stay private. Field origins and unknown acquisition requirements are
explicit. Blank future participant answers must never be auto-completed.
"""
